                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "requires": {
                  "all": [
                    {
                      "item": "sluice_crank"
                    },
                    {
                      "not": {
                        "flag": "kel_defeated"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "outcome": {
                  "text": "You have the crank, but Kel is still on his feet between you and the gate, and he isn't a man who steps aside."
                }
              },
              {
                "requires": {
                  "flag": "kel_defeated"
                },
                "outcome": {
                  "text": "The way to the gate is clear, but the crank socket is bare \u2014 the fitting was stripped for scrap. You need a crank that matches. The mill had one."
                }
              }
            ],
            "fallback": {
              "text": "A bare iron socket, jammed with rust. It wants a crank, and Kel wants your throat. Neither is solved by staring."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "wr_lookout",
          "label": "The Reservoir",
          "position": {
            "cell": {
              "x": 7,
              "y": 2
            }
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "examine",
            "text": "Above the weir the water stands deep and still, dark green, thick with the carp the baron stocked. Below it, Vessle cracks like old leather."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
